# SEO and Yoast Ownership

- Yoast is the primary owner for title, canonical, OG, and meta tags.
- Do not print duplicate title/canonical/meta tags from theme code.
- Extend schema carefully and avoid duplicate Organization entities.
- Keep canonical URLs aligned with approved slug map.
- Avoid noindex/noarchive broad rules unless explicitly requested.
- Any fallback SEO behavior must no-op safely when Yoast is active.

